{"version":1,"content":"<p>三星電子(KRX: 005930)今天發佈了截至9月30日的2026年第三季度財報。財報顯示，三星第三季度營收為195.25萬億韓元(約合1456億美元)，較上年同期的86.06萬億韓元增長126.88%；歸屬於三星母公司股東的淨利潤為75.21萬億韓元(約合561億美元)，較上年同期12萬億韓元增長526.39%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584288.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:02:22.897104+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:43:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_hash":"e6798473eba15b3fd80779cbbdc9a44e50b5634909a94e9a6e3649261c457b73","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}